{"availability":"available","full":"dont-code/ng-xtend","name":"ng-xtend","description":"Enable plugin extensions to your Angular application.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":3,"forks":1,"created":"2024-04-26T16:14:33Z","updated":"2026-10-11T07:21:54Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ng-xtend.dev","topics":["angular","plugins"],"demo":"https://dont-code.net/apps/latest/host/?project=Coffee%20Beans%20Evaluation","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.015Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.015Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.015Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.015Z","stars":3,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Angular"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Empower your Angular applications with a flexible, scalable plugin ecosystem! 🚀","The most successful web platforms —like WordPress, Nextcloud, or Drupal— thrive because of their massive plugin ecosystems. They make it effortless to extend functionality without touching the core.","In the Angular & TypeScript world, achieving this level of modularity has always been a challenge. ng-xtend was built to bridge that gap. It allows you to build \"extensible by design\" applications where external teams can contribute features seamlessly."],"features":["🧩 Define once, render anywhere: Focus on your data structures; let the plugins handle the UI.","⚡ Dynamic Loading: Load and install plugins at runtime—no rebuild required.","💾 Storage Agnostic: Save, load, and update data to any backend or storage.","🔌 Seamless Interop: Plugins work together intelligently, even without knowing each others."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dont-code/ng-xtend/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9dded57c3b5e61e4524e8e6dab9135acbe9342e52305c6c98fecd00048a043f3","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.112Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.112Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Empower your Angular appl